message: "If you use local-bench, please cite it as below, and cite the papers of the individual benchmarks you report."
title: "local-bench: a local LLM benchmark suite for macOS"
abstract: "Runs 42 LLM benchmarks against local and cloud models on a single Mac, with Docker-free sandboxing, frozen seeded subsets, a fixed cloud judge and a live dashboard."
